  "title": "Chocolate Chip-Pumpkin Spice Cake",
  "description": "Chocolate chips, pumpkin, bran flakes, walnuts, and fall-inspired spices bring sweet flavor to this easy cake.",
  "authors": [
    "Ariel A"
  ],
